      "dc:source": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/sources/1038/",
      "target": {
        "source": {
          "id": "https://figgy.princeton.edu/concern/scanned_resources/c7b8d5f6-a64f-4eb7-a900-ad74eea47ab0/manifest/canvas/b7537807-df21-4f68-b3a7-64350570349a",
          "type": "Canvas",
          "partOf": {
            "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/749/iiif/manifest/"
          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "SvgSelector",
          "value": "<svg><polygon points=\"449.7,2162.5 5278.1,2155.1 3356.6,5386.8 1386.5,5348\"></polygon></svg>"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>My lord and master and one to whom I am much indebted ...</li>\n<li>I asked God for guidance and, relying on the nobility of your character, I am returning you the dinar, for it is not</li>\n<li>good. You will receive also 500 sheets of paper which were in my possession, and in the possession of the son of</li>\n<li>m(aster) Obadiah, who is ill at present, and which belong to the son of Obadiah.</li>\n<li>Take notice of this. There is nothing new with me except that I shall be on my way to you next</li>\n<li>week, if God, the exalted, so decrees. And complete peace</li>\n<li>upon my lord and great master and God's mercy!</li>\n<li>An excuse, please.</li></ol>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
    {
      "etag": "\"a32d67bc440a38ff32dfbc31fac24b25\"",
      "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/annotations/84fbd63e-6d7b-42c5-b2a8-4c33f159a68b/",
      "type": "Annotation",
      "created": "2025-11-13T16:10:10.942073+00:00",
