    {
      "etag": "\"cfd11e280a3b1cc0ed05d9bd431f3be7\"",
      "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/annotations/bd2723fc-86a5-4296-b74d-d1391f17066d/",
      "type": "Annotation",
      "created": "2026-10-21T15:35:34.581353+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-10-21T15:42:35.166964+00:00",
      "dc:source": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/sources/22/",
      "target": {
        "source": {
          "id": "https://figgy.princeton.edu/concern/scanned_resources/c7b8d5f6-a64f-4eb7-a900-ad74eea47ab0/manifest/canvas/b7537807-df21-4f68-b3a7-64350570349a",
          "type": "Canvas",
          "partOf": {
            "id": "https://geniza.princeton.edu/documents/749/iiif/manifest/"
          }
        },
        "selector": {
          "type": "SvgSelector",
          "value": "<svg><polygon points=\"5108.8,2170.5 3326.8,5141.1 906.9,5219.9 530.7,2049\"></polygon></svg>"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol dir=\"ltr\"><li>O my lord and master, full of favor toward me and fleet of speech&nbsp;[&hellip;]</li>\n<li>I asked God for guidance, and relying on the nobility of your character, am returning to you the mithq\u0101l, since it is not</li>\n<li>good. There will also reach you five hundred leaves of paper that were with me and with the son of</li>\n<li>master \u02bfOvadya, who is now ill; they belong to the goods of Ibn \u02bfOvadya. [&hellip;]</li>\n<li>Be informed of this. I have no news except what has been arranged: my setting out toward you this</li>\n<li>coming week, if God the Exalted decrees. The most perfect greeting</li>\n<li>upon my lord and most exalted master, and the mercy of God.</li>\n<li>Sorry, sorry!</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
